@base = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@token = paste-parent-access-token
@student = 1
@main = 1
@savings = 2
@card = 1

### List schedules
GET {{base}}/payments/recurring-topups/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a weekly top-up (Mondays)
POST {{base}}/payments/recurring-topups/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "student": {{student}}, "amount": "4000", "channel": "momo", "payer_phone": "0772000111", "frequency": "weekly", "day_of_week": 0, "active": true }

### Pause
PATCH {{base}}/payments/recurring-topups/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "active": false }

### Resume / re-activate an auto-paused one (resets consecutive_failures)
PATCH {{base}}/payments/recurring-topups/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "active": true }

### Cancel
DELETE {{base}}/payments/recurring-topups/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
